The pizza pieces cover about 245 px by 190 px, which is roughly 14 cm by 11 cm. Looking closer, the shape is a few rectangular slices pushed together. The footprint is about 14 x 6 cm per row, and the pieces look about 2 cm thick. That gives roughly 100–120 cm² of area, or about 200 cm³ of volume. Pizza is dense, at roughly 0.5 g/cm³ once the air in the crust is allowed for, so this comes to about 100–130 g. I'll estimate 120 g for two to three small square slices.

